Legendary Homes Limited is a highly successful, multiple award-winning residential property development and construction firm operating across the Auckland region. Established in February 2013, the company has built a prominent reputation for mid-to-high-end turnkey housing packages, design-and-build projects, and large multi-unit townhouse developments. [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]
The company is headquartered at 94 Lucerne Road, Remuera, Auckland and anchors a robust property operational network spanning North, West, and South Auckland. [1, 2, 3]


